{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013pCNM6G8GY53QoMejLoQ4p","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{"commits":[{"hash":"e02e53320ba9657aa8406560c624972ed5f00e44","date":"2023-10-04T21:47:35+03:00","message":"(feat) Make the service worker opt-in for local dev (#780)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"407e982128c28ebd483b23325586f92617a77c48","date":"2023-02-28T02:15:17-08:00","message":"(feat) More useful service worker registration errors (#618)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"c103f2b1204c707f58fae527bcfc4005740f9f97","date":"2022-03-23T17:28:14+01:00","message":"(fix) Service Worker Housekeeping: Remove Unused SW Events | Fix SW Startup Cycle During Initial Load (#369)","refs":"","body":"* Removed the service worker's networkRequestFailed event infrastructure (as it became obsolete and is no longer used in any module).\r\n\r\n* Remove unused variable.\r\n\r\n* Ensure that the SW is responsible for new page registrations. Also clean up the offline setup and make it more robust (remove potential race-ish conditions).","authorName":"Manu Römer","authorEmail":"30902964+manuelroemer@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"762bbbc30cab9e793770269a9808c3c7126a867c","date":"2021-09-17T01:38:30+02:00","message":"Improved service worker to not rely on full offline package","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Florian Rappl","authorEmail":"florian.rappl@smapiot.com"},{"hash":"3298fa1c0d4f2bfd9b3cf2c73b9d3da3cc5dd358","date":"2021-06-30T11:33:58+02:00","message":"Service Worker Resilience: Retries of caching attempts (#140)","refs":"","body":"* Added basic retry behavior to the SW for file caching.\r\n\r\n* Prettier.\r\n\r\n* Increased retry attempts.\r\n\r\n* Introduce skipWaiting call.\r\n\r\n* Add skipWaiting to types.\r\n\r\n* Fixed invalid SW file error.\r\n\r\n* Replaced esm-framework import with concrete package.\r\n\r\n* Update NewVisitPayload type.","authorName":"Manuel Römer","authorEmail":"30902964+manuelroemer@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"5fd7e5592046e4d4f100a7363cfcb879a8156faa","date":"2021-04-15T11:42:03+02:00","message":"Enhanced SW to Window communication and dynamic route caching registrations (#97)","refs":"","body":"* Cache the user session endpoint.\r\n\r\n* Improve known URL handling.\r\n\r\n* Introduced workbox-window for service worker registration and resilient messaging.\r\n\r\n* Provide API in service worker for dynamically registering routes to be cached.\r\n\r\n* Use correct table names and message types.\r\n\r\n* Debug improvements.\r\n\r\n* Provide default arguments.\r\n\r\n* Improve message handling.\r\n\r\n* Fixed importmap not being imported.\r\n\r\n* Clear route registrations on startup. Added .editorconfig. Fixed line endings in package.json.\r\n\r\n* Fixed line endings in yarn.lock.","authorName":"Manuel Römer","authorEmail":"30902964+manuelroemer@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"b853f7055dc468424570f296e1877a4bb3b9f09f","date":"2021-04-14T10:15:16+02:00","message":"Service Worker: Bootstrapping Support for Offline MFs (#96)","refs":"","body":"* First (crude) app shell support for loading MFs.\r\nWarning: Bad code in a lot of places, needs refactoring.\r\nThis is mainly a PoC at this point.\r\n\r\n* Moved service-worker.ts to dedicated directory.\r\n\r\n* Improved service worker MF caching.\r\nRemoved obsolete routing.\r\nAdded improved console output on errors.\r\nImproved error handling.\r\n\r\n* Added basic cache invalidation for import maps.\r\n\r\n* Support nested importmap directories.\r\n\r\n* Documentation\r\n\r\n* Introduced support for 'setupOpenMRSOffline'.\r\n\r\n* Use === instead of ==.\r\n\r\n* Make onImportMap safer by preventing potential undefineds.\r\n\r\n* Renamed service-worker.ts to index.ts.\r\n\r\n* Fixed service worker output name.\r\n\r\n* Move onLine check when registering SW.\r\n\r\n* Removed helper functions in favor of lodash-es.\r\n\r\n* Fixed typo.\r\n\r\n* Fixed build.\r\n\r\n* lodash-es version alignment\r\n\r\n* lodash-es version alignment + lockfile","authorName":"Manuel Römer","authorEmail":"30902964+manuelroemer@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"c870113c006d16a2b879d507560631afc4eb1523","date":"2021-03-26T20:13:20+01:00","message":"Added a Service Worker, PWA-Manifest and Network-First Caching of static app shell files (#89)","refs":"","body":"* Rudimentary service worker integration into the app shell. Based on Google's Workbox project (stc).\r\n\r\n* Switch from Workbox's precaching strategy to a manual hybrid runtime/precache strategy.\r\n\r\n* Added PWA manifest to the app shell.\r\n\r\n* Updated default cache name.\r\n\r\n* Explicitly include the importmap URL in the precached app shell files in order to also have external URLs in place.\r\n\r\n* Fixed an issue with non-distinct precache URLs in cache.addAll().\r\n\r\n* Added PWA deps to openmrs.","authorName":"Manuel Römer","authorEmail":"30902964+manuelroemer@users.noreply.github.com"}],"totalCount":8}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bfb465e4-c8b2-4b61-a545-94b7863839b7","uuid":"7227238e-3ef2-4620-ad63-143517170382","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:04:42.779Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{"commits":[{"hash":"e02e53320ba9657aa8406560c624972ed5f00e44","date":"2023-10-04T21:47:35+03:00","message":"(feat) Make the service worker opt-in for local dev (#780)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"407e982128c28ebd483b23325586f92617a77c48","date":"2023-02-28T02:15:17-08:00","message":"(feat) More useful service worker registration errors (#618)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"c103f2b1204c707f58fae527bcfc4005740f9f97","date":"2022-03-23T17:28:14+01:00","message":"(fix) Service Worker Housekeeping: Remove Unused SW Events | Fix SW Startup Cycle During Init