1f9427facc507eb9.\n","authorName":"Ian","authorEmail":"ian_bacher@brown.edu"},{"hash":"181cf5302b7ef40a1e782e521f9427facc507eb9","date":"2023-04-05T23:18:33-07:00","message":"(revert) BREAKING: Refactor `usePatient` to account for offline patientsReverts v4.3.0 (#661)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"6cfad36c8cbb7e2c167d9e07faefc49532b4d10d","date":"2023-04-04T17:55:15-04:00","message":"BREAKING: Refactor `usePatient` to account for offline patients (#655)","refs":"","body":"* BREAKING Reactor usePatient to account for offline patients\r\n\r\n* Some idiot (me) broke run:shell, this fixes it\r\n\r\n* _summary=data... Probably should just add this into openmrsFetch\r\n\r\n* Add Dexie index for the most common query we run\r\n\r\n* openmrsFetch improvements (always ask the FHIR API for _summary=data)\r\n\r\n* Fix tests and undo new Dexie index (it doesn't work with the fake-indexdb)\r\n\r\n* Add some sanity to usePagination to avoid divide by zero\r\n\r\n* Fix new URL() call","authorName":"Ian","authorEmail":"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"0e3aafba4c26ff5868036bd89fb2cfc19eeaf84f","date":"2023-04-04T13:46:39-07:00","message":"(feat) Offline tools dashboard UI enhancements (#658)","refs":"","body":"* (feat) Offline tools dashboard UI enhancements\r\n\r\n* Update packages/apps/esm-offline-tools-app/src/offline-patients/offline-patient-table.component.tsx\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Ian <52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com>\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Ian <52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com>","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"991625e85e93607991d178318c36a191b75305bb","date":"2023-02-28T14:01:40Z","message":"(fix) Initialize config schema for esm-offline-tools-app (#620)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Jose Francisco","authorEmail":"94977371+icrc-jofrancisco@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"4c9d1571225ad5c4797bba1408c7fc8f8